            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "this fix is over-specific. These cases (at least) are still broken: `:split … :close`  , `:tabnew … :tabnext`\r\n\r\nyou can see code like this in the codebase, which maybe hints at a more likely path to success (I'm not certain, I would need to spend time thinking about it, which defeats the purpose of your PR):\r\n\r\n    did_check_timestamps = false;\r\n    need_check_timestamps = true;\r\n\r\n\r\nplease don't send anymore PRs without thinking through the solution. I'm also certain that I asked in your previous PRs about expectations regarding test verbosity.\r\n\r\n",
